    const claimLabel={N1:isZh()?"表示方式可以进入真实控制/行为链":"Representation can reach control/behavior",N2:isZh()?"可修复性有精确结构边界":"Repairability has an exact structural boundary",N3:isZh()?"简单 overlap 不是充分解释":"Raw overlap is not sufficient"};
